The existing strict source-pair comparison remains `matches: false`. No comparator or allowlist changed. These replays confirm post-merge per-input stop/UART and capture integrity only; S5-07 remains blocked/unaccepted. The next diagnostic is the bounded paired MMU-gather capture before `tlb_finish_mmu`, correlated to the shared `relocate_vma_down` cleanup context, not to run-2 event 26,596 alone.

Temporary runner artifacts are in ignored `work/stage5/s5-07-post-main-v18-baseline-exact-replay-20261117-a/`.
